  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">NTGL 是一个基于 MrCrayfish 枪械模组的功能强大的库，可让您向游戏添加各种类型的动画武器：枪支、近战武器、投掷物和 throwable。您可以使用枪包添加新武器或编辑现有武器，更多信息请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Jetug/NukaTeamGunLib/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NTGL 指南</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnjb6EKaDVJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152291880218939412?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=orange&link=https://discord.com/invite/njb6EKaDVJ\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fnukateam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/Boosty-Support_us-ff5f5f?logo=boosty&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">枪包系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">双持功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义武器 HUD</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">弹药类型切换</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">射击模式选择</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生物死亡特效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">活体实体可使用枪支</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">内置投射物类型：子弹、激光、电力、火焰、导弹、手榴弹</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>依赖项</strong></h2>\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1081/393/64/64/638621132937140582.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/871/312/256/256/638288810018379517.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></h3>\n<h2><strong>兼容于</strong></h2>\n<h3><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/477/479/64/64/637772195243234104_animated.gif\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/623/755/64/64/638018179275684974_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yyzsbackpack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1311/976/64/64/638853154143594604.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/375/56/64/64/637549610342642859.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controllable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/871/319/64/64/638288811093619347.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/588/418/64/64/637958435315527412.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/subtle-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1001/518/64/64/638521081241619465.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp&n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>",
